#: kiconeditslots.cpp:288
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The current file has been modified.\n"
"Do you want to save it?"
msgstr ""
"हालको फाइल परिमार्जन गरिएको छ ।\n"
"यसलाई तपाईँ बचत गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ?"

#: kiconedit.cpp:253
#, kde-format
msgid "New &Window"
msgstr "नयाँ सञ्झ्याल"

#: kiconedit.cpp:256
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"New window\n"
"\n"
"Opens a new icon editor window."
msgstr ""
"नयाँ सञ्झ्याल\n"
"\n"
"ले नयाँ प्रतिमा सम्पादक सञ्झ्याल खोल्दछ ।"

#: kiconedit.cpp:259
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"New\n"
"\n"
"Create a new icon, either from a template or by specifying the size"
msgstr ""
"नयाँ\n"
"\n"
"या त टेम्प्लेटबाट वा साइज निर्दिष्ट गरेर, नयाँ प्रतिमा सिर्जना गर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:263
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Open\n"
"\n"
"Open an existing icon"
msgstr ""
"खोल्नुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"एउटा अवस्थित प्रतिमा खोल्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:271
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Save\n"
"\n"
"Save the current icon"
msgstr ""
"बचत गर्नुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"हालको प्रतिमा बचत गर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Print\n"
"\n"
"Opens a print dialog to let you print the current icon."
msgstr ""
"मुद्रण गर्नुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"तपाईँलाई हालको प्रतिमा मुद्रण गर्न दिन मुद्रण संवाद खोल्दछ ।"

#: kiconedit.cpp:284
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cut\n"
"\n"
"Cut the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"काट्नुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"प्रतिमा बाहिरको हालको चयन काट्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\n"
"(टिप: तपाईँ दुवै आयातकार र वृत्तकार चयनहरू बनाउन सक्नुहुन्छ)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:288
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Copy\n"
"\n"
"Copy the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"काट्नुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"प्रतिमा बाहिरको हालको चयन प्रतिलिपि गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\n"
"(टिप: तपाईँ दुवै आयातकार र वृत्तकार चयन बनाउन सक्नुहुन्छ)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:292
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Paste\n"
"\n"
"Paste the contents of the clipboard into the current icon.\n"
"\n"
"If the contents are larger than the current icon you can paste them in a new "
"window.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Select \"Paste transparent pixels\" in the configuration dialog if you "
"also want to paste transparency.)"
msgstr ""
"टाँस्नुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"हालको प्रतिमामा क्लिपबोर्डका सामग्री टाँस्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\n"
"यदि सामग्रीहरू हालको प्रतिमा भन्दा ठूला छन् भने तपाईँ त्यसलाई नयाँ सञ्झ्यालमा टाँस्न "
"सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\n"
"(टिप: यदि तपाईँ पार्दर्शीता पनि टाँस्न चाहनुहुन्छ भने कन्फिगरेसन संवादमा \"पारदर्शी पिक्सेल "
"टाँस्नुहोस्\" चयन गर्नुहोस् ।)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:300
#, kde-format
msgid "Paste as &New"
msgstr "नयाँको रूपमा टाँस्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:309
#, kde-format
msgid "Resi&ze..."
msgstr "रिसाइज गर्नुहोस्..."

#: kiconedit.cpp:312
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Resize\n"
"\n"
"Smoothly resizes the icon while trying to preserve the contents"
msgstr ""
"रिसाइज\n"
"\n"
"सामग्रीहरू संरक्षण गर्ने प्रयास गर्दा महीन रूपमा प्रतिमा रिसाइज गर्दछ"

#: kiconedit.cpp:317
#, kde-format
msgid "&GrayScale"
msgstr "ग्रेस्केल"

#: kiconedit.cpp:320
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Gray scale\n"
"\n"
"Gray scale the current icon.\n"
"(Warning: The result is likely to contain colors not in the icon palette"
msgstr ""
"ग्रेस्केल\n"
"\n"
"हालको प्रतिमा ग्रेस्केल गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"(चेतावनी: नतिजा प्रतिमा रङदानीमा होइन रङ समाविष्ट गर्ने जस्तो देखिन्छ)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:327
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Zoom in\n"
"\n"
"Zoom in by one."
msgstr ""
"जुम बढाउनुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"एउटाले जुम बढाउनुहोस् ।"

#: kiconedit.cpp:331
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Zoom out\n"
"\n"
"Zoom out by one."
msgstr ""
"जुम घटाउनुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"एउटाले जुम घटाउनुहोस् ।"

#: kiconedit.cpp:335
#, kde-format
msgid "&Zoom"
msgstr ""

#: kiconedit.cpp:339
#, kde-format
msgid "100%"
msgstr "१००%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:345
#, kde-format
msgid "200%"
msgstr "२००%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:351
#, kde-format
msgid "500%"
msgstr "५००%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:357
#, kde-format
msgid "1000%"
msgstr "१०००%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:377
#, kde-format
msgid "Show &Grid"
msgstr "ग्रिड देखाउनुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:380
#, kde-format
msgid "Hide &Grid"
msgstr "ग्रिड लुकाउनुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:381
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Show grid\n"
"\n"
"Toggles the grid in the icon edit grid on/off"
msgstr ""
"ग्रिड देखाउनुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"प्रतिमा सम्पादन ग्रिड खूल्ला/बन्दमा ग्रिड टगल गर्दछ"

#: kiconedit.cpp:388
#, kde-format
msgid "Color Picker"
msgstr "रङ पिकर"

#: kiconedit.cpp:392
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Color Picker\n"
"\n"
"The color of the pixel clicked on will be the current draw color"
msgstr ""
"रङ पिकर\n"
"\n"
"पिक्सेलको रङ क्लिक गर्नाले हालको रङ कोर्नेछ"

#: kiconedit.cpp:397
#, kde-format
msgid "Freehand"
msgstr "फ्रिह्यान्ड"

#: kiconedit.cpp:401
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Free hand\n"
"\n"
"Draw non-linear lines"
msgstr ""
"फ्रिह्यान्ड\n"
"\n"
"बक्र रेखाहरू कोर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:408
#, kde-format
msgid "Rectangle"
msgstr "आयात"

#: kiconedit.cpp:412
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a rectangle"
msgstr ""
"आयात\n"
"\n"
"आयात कोर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:416
#, kde-format
msgid "Filled Rectangle"
msgstr "भरिएको आयात"

#: kiconedit.cpp:420
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Filled rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled rectangle"
msgstr ""
"भरिएको आयात\n"
"\n"
"भरिएको आयात कोर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:424
#, kde-format
msgid "Circle"
msgstr "वृत्त"

#: kiconedit.cpp:428
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a circle"
msgstr ""
"वृत्त\n"
"\n"
"वृत्त कोर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:432
#, kde-format
msgid "Filled Circle"
msgstr "भरिएको वृत्त"

#: kiconedit.cpp:436
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Filled circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled circle"
msgstr ""
"भरिएको वृत्त\n"
"\n"
"भरिएको वृत्त कोर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:440
#, kde-format
msgid "Ellipse"
msgstr "दीर्घवृत"

#: kiconedit.cpp:444
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw an ellipse"
msgstr ""
"दीर्घवृत्त\n"
"\n"
"एउटा दीर्घवृत्त कोर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:448
#, kde-format
msgid "Filled Ellipse"
msgstr "भरिएको दीर्घवृत्त"

#: kiconedit.cpp:452
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Filled ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled ellipse"
msgstr ""
"भरिएको दीर्घवृत्त\n"
"\n"
"भरिएको दीर्घवृत्त कोर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:456
#, kde-format
msgid "Spray"
msgstr "स्प्रे"

#: kiconedit.cpp:460
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Spray\n"
"\n"
"Draw scattered pixels in the current color"
msgstr ""
"स्प्रे\n"
"\n"
"हालको रङमा छरिएको पिक्सेल कोर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:465
#, kde-format
msgid "Flood Fill"
msgstr "जलमग्न भराई"

#: kiconedit.cpp:469
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Flood fill\n"
"\n"
"Fill adjoining pixels with the same color with the current color"
msgstr ""
"जलमग्न भराई\n"
"\n"
"हालको रङसँग उस्तै रङमा जोडिएको पिक्सेल भर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:474
#, kde-format
msgid "Line"
msgstr "रेखा"

#: kiconedit.cpp:478
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Line\n"
"\n"
"Draw a straight line vertically, horizontally or at 45 deg. angles"
msgstr ""
"रेखा\n"
"\n"
"ठाडो, तेर्सो वा ४५ डिग्रीको कोणमा सीधा रेखा कोर्नुहोस्"

#: kiconedit.cpp:483
#, kde-format
msgid "Eraser (Transparent)"
msgstr "मेटाउने (पारदर्शी)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:487
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Erase\n"
"\n"
"Erase pixels. Set the pixels to be transparent\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: If you want to draw transparency with a different tool, first click on "
"\"Erase\" then on the tool you want to use)"
msgstr ""
"मेट्नुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"पिक्सेल मेट्नुहोस्होस् । पिक्सेल पारदर्शी हुन सेट गर्नुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"(टिप: यदि तपाईँ विभिन्न उपकरण सहित पारदर्शीता कोर्न चाहनुहुन्छ भने, पहिले \"मेट्नुहोस्\" "
"मा क्लिक गर्नुहोस् त्यसपछि तपाईँले प्रयोग गर्ने उपकरणमा)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:494
#, kde-format
msgid "Rectangular Selection"
msgstr "आयातकार चयन"

#: kiconedit.cpp:498
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select\n"
"\n"
"Select a rectangular section of the icon using the mouse."
msgstr ""
"चयन गर्नुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"माउस प्रयोग गरेर प्रतिमाको आयातकार खण्ड चयन गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: kiconedit.cpp:503
#, kde-format
msgid "Circular Selection"
msgstr "वृत्तकार चयन"

#: kiconedit.cpp:507
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select\n"
"\n"
"Select a circular section of the icon using the mouse."
msgstr ""
"चयन गर्नुहोस्\n"
"\n"
"माउस प्रयोग गरेर प्रतिमाको वृत्तकार चयन चयन गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: kiconedit.cpp:535
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Statusbar\n"
"\n"
"The statusbar gives information on the status of the current icon. The "
"fields are:\n"
"\n"
"\t- Application messages\n"
"\t- Cursor position\n"
"\t- Size\n"
"\t- Zoom factor\n"
"\t- Number of colors"
msgstr ""
"वस्तुस्थितिपट्टी\n"
"\n"
"वस्तुस्थितिपट्टीले हालको प्रतिमाको वस्तुस्थितिमा सूचना दिन्छ । फाँटहरू निम्न छन्:\n"
"\n"
"\t- अनुप्रयोग सन्देश\n"
"\t- कर्सर स्थिति\n"
"\t- साइज\n"
"\t- जुम तत्व\n"
"\t- रङका सङ्ख्या"

#: kiconedit.cpp:544 kiconeditslots.cpp:451 kiconeditslots.cpp:457
#, kde-format
